<title>USA: Merrill names LeMaire head of new Latam efforts.</title>
<headline>Merrill names LeMaire head of new Latam efforts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co on Wednesday said it named Dominique LeMaire as a director in charge of structured finance and securitization for Latin America.</p>
<p>LeMaire will report to Ed Somekh, managing director and head of the Latin America Capital Markets and Client Strategy Group, the investment bank said.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Merrill, LeMaire had spent five years as head of J.P. Morgan &amp; Co Inc's Latin America structured finance and securitization operation.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
